    "cpu": "forbidden by DevicePolicy unless opted in",
    "doNotUnifyIntoOneServer": "OVMS owns NPU/GPU IR; Ollama owns GGUF. Same LlmProfile schema, two runtimes. Do not serve the product embedder on both."
